// The seed lies in a walled pocket; the ripple rose in the open.
name The Cistern
rule B1/S012345678
steps 3
hint You woke without a seed. One lies in the dark behind the wall. Find it, then find where the ripple began.
tip The pocket in the corner has one way in, on its right side. The ripple's centre is the middle of its symmetric shape.
intro Past the last ruin you thought was last, the ground goes on. This time you wake empty-handed. Whatever was planted here was carried in from somewhere else.
outro A seed is a thing you carry before it is a thing you plant.
